# TeamX project DNS records (Phase 2)
# The SAME file goes on BOTH DNS servers:
#   Mac 1 (primary, 10.7.23.138)  and  Mac 3 (backup, 10.7.3.174)
# Path on each Mac: /opt/homebrew/etc/teamx.hosts   (Intel Mac: /usr/local/etc/teamx.hosts)
#
# After editing, reload WITHOUT restarting dnsmasq:   sudo killall -HUP dnsmasq
#
# --- NORMAL STATE: both names -> primary edge (Mac 2) ---
10.7.3.38   app.teamX.test
10.7.3.38   api.teamX.test

# --- Extension B TTL demo record (safe to change: nothing serves it) ---
# change 10.7.3.38 -> 10.7.31.162, then: sudo killall -HUP dnsmasq  (on BOTH DNS Macs)
10.7.3.38   ttl.teamX.test

